      "content": "Actually, can we tone down the \"wizard\" and \"enchanted\" language? This is a formal medical symposium, so we need the timeline to be professional and strictly practical for the staff. Also, can you add specific time slots for when the AV team needs to finish their final test and exactly when the coffee service needs to be live for the attendees? We can't afford any delays during the opening remarks.",
